  ('a331c1c8-6761-597f-92a4-8196afa7366f','de6aeb67-affa-55ab-a64b-6a48f55dcc19',1,'A','Because the charges are equal in magnitude'),
  ('419a2ad8-147d-5aa6-ab42-626b5b2a7b65','de6aeb67-affa-55ab-a64b-6a48f55dcc19',1,'B','Because Coulomb''s law is consistent with Newton''s third law'),
  ('63002657-8244-5275-b4a5-462db5259cc3','de6aeb67-affa-55ab-a64b-6a48f55dcc19',1,'C','Because the triangle is equilateral'),
  ('4c8afeaa-8aa2-5831-8372-2f04a7fb33f9','de6aeb67-affa-55ab-a64b-6a48f55dcc19',1,'D','Because the charges are at rest'),
  ('1c44226c-47ba-52ba-a354-1c1759d4d566','2469e8a2-f37c-533a-a82c-f8a18e07fe9a',1,'A','E is the potential energy per unit charge'),
  ('da48abff-2916-5f1c-bc71-9dda972fe952','2469e8a2-f37c-533a-a82c-f8a18e07fe9a',1,'B','E is the force per unit positive test charge placed at that point'),
  ('177d0bce-4380-5cf1-83fc-f31cbc997413','2469e8a2-f37c-533a-a82c-f8a18e07fe9a',1,'C','E is the total charge divided by distance'),
  ('742b2b59-9f30-57a6-a4b7-5c1c59609bb2','2469e8a2-f37c-533a-a82c-f8a18e07fe9a',1,'D','E is the work done per unit distance'),
  ('f2d91e95-61e2-5f22-aefd-926a93f3de82','f216d7d2-2d6d-5e42-9e39-e353b3f03910',1,'A','E = (1/4πε0)(Q/r)r̂'),
  ('608c6fb6-09cd-50d1-84f5-507cd4cc0b2d','f216d7d2-2d6d-5e42-9e39-e353b3f03910',1,'B','E = (1/4πε0)(Q/r²)r̂'),
  ('ca8213d5-c950-53dc-9f28-30d08f32f996','f216d7d2-2d6d-5e42-9e39-e353b3f03910',1,'C','E = (1/4πε0)(Q/r³)r̂'),
  ('728947a4-56f5-5dac-87d6-74cbc19b1da9','f216d7d2-2d6d-5e42-9e39-e353b3f03910',1,'D','E = (1/4πε0)(Qr²)r̂'),
  ('851f6ce3-a224-52c4-ac37-c9f89bfb1a60','f8ffa2c4-bcea-58bf-b2e3-574bd7f364ca',1,'A','F = E/q'),
  ('95e1e3ca-dda6-5533-99cf-f894192aef6d','f8ffa2c4-bcea-58bf-b2e3-574bd7f364ca',1,'B','F = qE'),
  ('66616b6a-6ec8-529b-a3ba-3a77beee93d6','f8ffa2c4-bcea-58bf-b2e3-574bd7f364ca',1,'C','F = q/E'),
  ('c569d0df-f299-5d11-9b7e-b6e7090f8f4a','f8ffa2c4-bcea-58bf-b2e3-574bd7f364ca',1,'D','F = q²E'),
  ('aa213645-6b35-51d5-b66e-b114426f4b87','cae151cf-dade-51e9-8a40-9820a59e65a0',1,'A','Coulomb (C)'),
