  ('3fe82aa6-8232-5a8c-8d40-5151c5b2b02c','ff36548a-0b17-57aa-88ba-d6aaaca4315b',1,'A','Source charge is negative, test charge is positive'),
  ('74bb6e77-4f5f-5172-91aa-6ab53e335561','ff36548a-0b17-57aa-88ba-d6aaaca4315b',1,'B','Source charge produces the field, test charge detects the field'),
  ('67db32d7-7b55-5074-8db7-ddb1330add07','ff36548a-0b17-57aa-88ba-d6aaaca4315b',1,'C','Source charge is larger, test charge is smaller'),
  ('4a4b9273-660e-53e7-8f22-9621f67dc687','ff36548a-0b17-57aa-88ba-d6aaaca4315b',1,'D','Source charge is at rest, test charge is moving'),
  ('a4bab5be-4562-5849-a96a-8504892b701c','fa972651-b1a3-5fcd-a631-765aa420cafc',1,'A','Because Q and q are equal'),
  ('10a7130f-fc9e-5f2e-a3c6-d4db38b187a5','fa972651-b1a3-5fcd-a631-765aa420cafc',1,'B','Because F is proportional to q, so F/q does not depend on q'),
  ('af6ef7b1-5605-524f-ad0c-40d7b2359316','fa972651-b1a3-5fcd-a631-765aa420cafc',1,'C','Because q is always very small'),
  ('179a809e-39e9-596c-99bf-3d5aa24e9513','fa972651-b1a3-5fcd-a631-765aa420cafc',1,'D','Because E depends only on distance'),
  ('1075f599-0cbc-5d71-8e43-c505c329ac4e','848b7f9e-623c-5ad8-a633-d9b5158bcf06',1,'A','Radially inward toward the charge'),
