  ('ee9d4d1d-40a0-5272-85d6-e946f7db8f1e','8f258000-8597-579d-84eb-b45970abf07a',1,'C','Faraday called them lines of force'),
  ('dd62c807-75e0-5669-baf7-0cdb0516ff94','8f258000-8597-579d-84eb-b45970abf07a',1,'D','Maxwell called them electromagnetic waves'),
  ('d1db109c-1537-5d7e-b7f3-706972b73f2f','b3e7f8a7-02f4-5594-bc19-47651d1ec19b',1,'A','A straight line connecting two charges'),
  ('990922d0-60ff-5d3d-ac9e-813922ad7c6d','b3e7f8a7-02f4-5594-bc19-47651d1ec19b',1,'B','A curve where the tangent at each point gives the direction of the net electric field'),
