  ('1389118d-5af2-5bcd-98b2-16b15a986ef5','0f943a22-8b99-590c-b67d-cfdacaba4ff7',1,'A','They exist only in two dimensions'),
  ('c9e0a47e-2a8d-57e6-b349-4f2360ddc80e','0f943a22-8b99-590c-b67d-cfdacaba4ff7',1,'B','They are curves in three-dimensional space'),
  ('b91406eb-9acf-5f30-a3fe-03930e2e6988','0f943a22-8b99-590c-b67d-cfdacaba4ff7',1,'C','They have no physical existence'),
