  ('144040d3-377c-573f-8e7c-a1b8099549e2','a6748e4b-fa16-5368-a34d-0f4cb76fba39',1,'C','They start from positive charges and end at negative charges'),
  ('902cd334-619b-56fa-b0f9-b6b1e7686f00','a6748e4b-fa16-5368-a34d-0f4cb76fba39',1,'D','They have no specific starting or ending points'),
  ('ee1b2038-f91a-548b-9954-2e0886ec9e8a','1e758cca-3c9a-5425-95e2-7095a7c908fc',1,'A','Because they would create infinite field strength'),
  ('8677b1e3-d7b3-5794-9c87-0f5dfc8e26d3','1e758cca-3c9a-5425-95e2-7095a7c908fc',1,'B','Because the field at the intersection would not have a unique direction'),
  ('4cd8c472-a05c-584f-bfbc-78602847a798','1e758cca-3c9a-5425-95e2-7095a7c908fc',1,'C','Because charges would annihilate each other'),
