  ('210a3972-ae7f-5524-97cf-1cabb4c4339d','fd741702-7b79-5b18-a8f8-f645d585c566',1,'A','The electric field varies continuously across the surface'),
  ('861e4850-eada-5bd2-b6e4-5e6f2114f306','fd741702-7b79-5b18-a8f8-f645d585c566',1,'B','The potential has a constant value at all points on the surface'),
  ('70fd29b0-db8f-5ca9-8484-bf8b4b0caadb','fd741702-7b79-5b18-a8f8-f645d585c566',1,'C','The surface charge density is uniform throughout'),
  ('5d6f2c5b-2039-53a1-96aa-ed8a50a7607a','fd741702-7b79-5b18-a8f8-f645d585c566',1,'D','The electric field is parallel to the surface at every point'),
